guide forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus
title Silithus, Western Plaguelands & Eastern Plaguelands
faction Horde
levels 57-59
zone Silithus
next forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood
# Built from the simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits 94-101) and
# machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Valor's Rest (the Un'Goro pass) -> Southwind Village -> Valor's Rest
# -> Southwind tower -> Cenarion Hold (flight path, bind) -> Dredge and
# scorpids north of the hold -> Twilight Base Camp -> Cenarion Hold -> Hermit
# Ortell -> General Kirika and the Silithyst -> the southern dunes -> Twilight
# Vanguard -> the western dunes and Twilight Post -> Twilight Outpost ->
# Cenarion Hold -> Noggle's satchel in the far south -> Ortell ->
# hearth to Cenarion Hold -> Valor's Rest -> through the pass to Marshal's
# Refuge (Linken, Quixxil) -> fly to Gadgetzan (Egg-O-Matic) -> fly to
# Orgrimmar (train) -> zeppelin to the Undercity (Sylvanas) -> the Bulwark ->
# Felstone Field -> Andorhal -> the Bulwark -> Dalson's Tears -> Northridge ->
# Davil's Libram -> Tirion Fordring -> Redpath's Shield -> Light's Hope Chapel
# -> Scourge Champions -> Light's Hope -> Pamela and the Undercroft ->
# Nathanos -> Tirion -> Chromie -> the Bulwark. Ends at the Bulwark, next to
# the Undercity, where 07 starts.
#
# Deviations from the export, for one clean loop per hub:
# - Silithus: the Wasteland chain (1124-1126) is done on arrival, since the
#   Un'Goro pass comes out at Valor's Rest; Layo's last turn-in waits until
#   you leave through the same pass. One hearth (Ortell -> Cenarion Hold)
#   instead of two; the Gadgetzan bind is dropped (no hearth uses it).
# - Un'Goro and Tanaris: only the stops on the flight path home (Marshal's
#   Refuge, Gadgetzan). Dropped: Pawn Captures Queen and its Calm Before the
#   Storm follow-ups (4507, 4509, 4511: the Gorishi hive is a long ride south
#   for one chain) and Volcanic Activity (4502: turned in at Ratchet after
#   60). Linken's Memory (3942) is kept: 07 hands it in at the Emerald
#   Sanctuary on its way north through Felwood.
# - Western Plaguelands: the Bulwark is visited on the way in, again after
#   Andorhal, and on the way out (A Plague Upon Thee); Dalson's Tears comes
#   right after the second Bulwark stop instead of at the end.
# - Eastern Plaguelands: the export's later Plaguelands stop from 07 (visit
#   112: Duke Zverenhoff 6030, Little Pamela 5142, Nathanos 5961) is folded
#   into this guide's one trip east; Sylvanas' Champion of the Banshee Queen
#   (5961) is picked up in the Undercity on the way.
# - Added: A Matter of Time (4971, 5800 XP). 02 reaches Chromie before
#   level 53, so she offers it here instead: accepted at her inn when you
#   ride into Andorhal for the watchtowers, done at the silos in the same
#   sweep, handed in at the closing Chromie stop. Counting Out Time
#   (4972/4973) is left out: it sends you searching Andorhal's houses again.
# - Cenarion Hold, riding in from the west: Bor Wildmane, on the west side,
#   before Proudhorn and the Ficklesprags.
#
# Left out (besides the above): Stormers and Rumblers (6805: turned in to
# Duke Hydraxis after 60), Skeletal Fragments (964: never turned in),
# Felstone Field Cauldron (5218: repeatable), the second Return to the
# Bulwark (5232) and Of Lost Honor (5845: never turned in), Shards of the
# Felvine (5526: Dire Maul), The Battle of Darrowshire and Hidden Treasures
# (5721, 5942: Horgus the Ravager and Redpath the Corrupted are elite, and
# Darrowshire is a detour back east), Dearest Natalia (8304: Mar'alith only
# offers it from level 58, which the route does not reach in Silithus without
# a two-hour grind; with it go the questions at Bronzebeard's Encampment and
# Into the Maw of Madness, 8306, among Hive'Regal elites) and Ortell's Still
# Believing (8324, reputation).
# - Secret Communication (8318) needs level 57: Bor Wildmane's quest is taken
#   at the second Cenarion Hold stop, after the cultist camps, and handed in
#   on the spot with the texts collected on the way (they drop without it).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Valor's Rest and Southwind

step Layo Starstrike
  tip The pass from Un'Goro comes out at Valor's Rest, the graveyard in north-east Silithus. Layo stands among the graves.
  turnin 1124
  accept 1125

step The Spirits of Southwind
  tip Ride south-west to the ruins of Southwind Village. The Dusty Reliquary for Rabine Saturna sits inside one of the ruined houses.
  kill 12178 quest 1125.1
  kill 12179 quest 1125.2
  collect 22201 quest 5527.1

step Layo Starstrike
  turnin 1125
  accept 1126

step Hive in the Tower
  tip Back to Southwind and climb the tower. Stirring the hive at the top brings out Hive'Ashi Ambushers; one carries the Encrusted Silithid Object.
  collect 17346 quest 1126.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Cenarion Hold

step Cenarion Hold
  tip Ride west to the walled hold in the middle of the desert.
  getfp "Cenarion Hold"
  sethome "Cenarion Hold"
  turnin 8276                         -- Windcaller Proudhorn
  accept 8280
  accept 8277                         -- Beetix Ficklespragg
  accept 8284                         -- Geologist Larksbane
  accept 9416                         -- Scout Bloodfist

step Dredge and scorpids
  tip Dredge Strikers, Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers share the sands just north of the hold.
  kill 11740 quest 8280.1
  collect 20373 quest 8277.1
  collect 20376 quest 8277.2

step Twilight Base Camp
  tip The glowing tablet fragments lie around the Twilight camp in the far north-west; the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers there drop them too.
  collect 20378 quest 8284.1

step Cenarion Hold
  turnin 8280                         -- Windcaller Proudhorn
  accept 8281
  turnin 8277                         -- Beetix Ficklespragg
  accept 8278
  turnin 8284                         -- Geologist Larksbane
  accept 8285

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south and the west

step Hermit Ortell
  tip Ride south-east to Ortell's Hideout under the Un'Goro cliffs.
  turnin 8285
  accept 8279

step General Kirika
  tip Ride west to the Horde camp north of Hive'Regal.
  turnin 9416
  accept 9422

step Scouring the Desert
  tip Silithyst geysers erupt across the southern desert. Walk into the Silithyst one leaves behind and carry it to the Horde's Silithyst Extractor at Kirika's camp; fighting or mounting drops it.
  complete 9422 @50.93,69.33 era
  turnin 9422                         -- General Kirika

step Flayers and Rock Stalkers
  tip Stonelash Flayers and Rock Stalkers roam the dunes south-west of Kirika's camp.
  collect 20375 quest 8278.1
  collect 20377 quest 8278.3

step Twilight Vanguard
  tip Twilight Keeper Exeter walks the Vanguard camp in the far south-west. Every cultist here drops Encrypted Twilight Texts, quest or not: collect twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Ortell.
  collect 20395 quest 8279.2
  collect 20404 x10

step Dredge Crushers and Pincers
  tip Head north along the western dunes; Dredge Crushers and Stonelash Pincers range from here back toward the hold.
  kill 11741 quest 8281.1
  collect 20374 quest 8278.2

step Twilight Post
  tip Twilight Keeper Mayna holds the camp in the west.
  collect 20394 quest 8279.1

step Twilight Outpost
  tip Twilight Keeper Havunth stands in the outpost west of Cenarion Hold. Top your Encrypted Twilight Texts up to twenty on the cultists here.
  collect 20396 quest 8279.3
  collect 20404 x20

step Cenarion Hold
  accept 8318                         -- Bor Wildmane, on the west side of the Hold
  turnin 8318
  turnin 8281                         -- Windcaller Proudhorn
  turnin 8278                         -- Beetix Ficklespragg
  accept 8282                         -- Noggle Ficklespragg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Noggle's satchel and Ortell

step Noggle's Lost Satchel
  tip The satchel lies in the mountains of the far south, past Bronzebeard's Encampment. Deathclasp, an elite scorpid, patrols near it: grab it while he is away.
  collect 20379 quest 8282.1

step Hermit Ortell
  tip Ride north-east to Ortell's Hideout.
  turnin 8279
  accept 8287
  accept 8323
  collect 20404 quest 8323.1          -- The spare texts from the cultists
  turnin 8323

step Back to Cenarion Hold
  hearth "Cenarion Hold"
  turnin 8287                         -- Commander Mar'alith
  turnin 8282                         -- Noggle Ficklespragg
  note Mar'alith's Dearest Natalia needs level 58 and leads into Hive'Regal among elites. Skip it.

step Layo Starstrike
  tip Ride north-east to Valor's Rest; you leave Silithus through the pass beside it.
  turnin 1126
  accept 6844

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Marshal's Refuge and Gadgetzan

step Marshal's Refuge
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Through the pass and east along the northern cliffs to Marshal's Refuge. Linken stands by the cave; J.D. Collie is inside it.
  kill 10977 quest 5163.3             -- Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti on Quixxil
  turnin 3914                         -- Linken
  accept 3941
  turnin 3941                         -- J.D. Collie
  accept 3942
  note Keep Linken's Memory: Eridan Bluewind is at the Emerald Sanctuary, on the next guide's way through Felwood.

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip Fly to Gadgetzan. The Egg-O-Matic stands in the middle of town.
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  turnin 2741

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Fly to Orgrimmar and train.
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step The Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades and ride into the Undercity. Lady Sylvanas holds the Royal Quarter.
  accept 5961

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Western Plaguelands

step The Bulwark
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Ride east along the road to the Bulwark on the border.
  turnin 6029                         -- Argent Officer Garush

step Felstone Field
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Janice Felstone's farm is the first one east of the Bulwark. Jabbering Ghouls on the farm carry the other half of her charm; Cauldron Lord Bilemaw guards the cauldron in the field.
  turnin 5050
  accept 5051
  collect 12722 x1 "Good Luck Other-Half-Charm"
  complete 5051
  turnin 5051
  collect 13194 quest 5229.1
  turnin 5229                         -- Scourge Cauldron
  accept 5230

step Andorhal watchtowers and silos
  tip Ride south into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town. Stand in the doorway of each of the four towers with the Beacon Torch to mark it; keep to the edges of town. Use the Temporal Displacer by the silos in the middle of town to bring out Temporal Parasites.
  accept 4971                         -- Chromie
  kill 10717 quest 4971.1
  kill 10904 quest 5098.3 "Mark Andorhal Tower Three with the Beacon Torch"
  kill 10903 quest 5098.2 "Mark Andorhal Tower Two with the Beacon Torch"
  kill 10902 quest 5098.1 "Mark Andorhal Tower One with the Beacon Torch"
  kill 10905 quest 5098.4 "Mark Andorhal Tower Four with the Beacon Torch"

step The Bulwark
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  turnin 5098                         -- High Executor Derrington
  accept 838
  turnin 838                          -- Apothecary Dithers
  turnin 5230                         -- Shadow Priestess Vandis
  accept 5231
  note Dithers offers Skeletal Fragments (Scholomance). Skip it.

step Dalson's Tears
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip East along the road, Cauldron Lord Malvinious guards the cauldron at Dalson's Tears.
  collect 13195 quest 5231.1
  turnin 5231                         -- Scourge Cauldron

step Northridge Lumber Camp
  tip North to the lumber camp; set the termite barrel down in the middle of the mill.
  turnin 5902
  accept 6390

step Davil's Libram
  tip The libram lies further north, on the way to Hearthglen.
  collect 12954 quest 5168.1

step Tirion Fordring
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Ride east to Tirion's hut by the Thondroril River and hear him out.
  turnin 5543
  turnin 5544
  turnin 5542
  accept 5742
  complete 5742
  turnin 5742
  accept 5781

step Redpath's Shield
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip The shield lies at Gahrron's Withering, south of Tirion's hut.
  collect 12955 quest 5168.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Eastern Plaguelands

step Light's Hope Chapel
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Ride east across the plaguelands to the chapel.
  turnin 5168                         -- Carlin Redpath
  accept 5206
  turnin 6030                         -- Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff

step Scourge Champions
  tip Scourge Champions roam the Noxious Glade, north of the chapel. Pass Carlin's Mystic Crystal over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants.
  collect 13155 quest 5206.1 @81.5,44.0

step Light's Hope Chapel
  turnin 5206                         -- Carlin Redpath
  accept 5941

step Pamela and the Undercroft
  tip Ride to Darrowshire in the south-west; Pamela plays among the houses. Mercutio Filthgorger lurks in the Undercroft, the crypt just west of the town.
  turnin 5142
  collect 14613 quest 5781.1
  note Pamela's own errand is not on this route. Skip it.

step Nathanos Blightcaller
  tip The Banshee Queen's champion holds the Marris Stead farmhouse, north of the Undercroft.
  turnin 5961
  note Nathanos' errands are not on this route. Skip them.

step Tirion Fordring
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Ride north-west to Tirion's hut.
  turnin 5781
  note Tirion's next task, Of Lost Honor, is not on this route. Skip it.

step Chromie
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Ride south-west to Chromie in Andorhal.
  turnin 4971
  turnin 5941
  note Chromie's Battle of Darrowshire ends against elites. Skip it.

step The Bulwark
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip West to the Bulwark. The next guide starts in the Undercity, a short ride west.
  turnin 6390                         -- Mickey Levine
